{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive with just <strong>one\u00a0gold</strong>, and you want their <strong>ruby</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade, do quests, manage your resources wisely to get <strong>richer</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to locals and grow friendships, all while discovering their lore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif27674.gif?t=1747516379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Befriend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've officially come to help the village to recover from its recent hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(And officiously, to obtain their ruby.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish the locals' quests to gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif102017.gif?t=1747516379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more you help a local though quests, the more trades he propose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif83887.gif?t=1747516379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Enrich</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tools are the main engine of your economic growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif54130.gif?t=1747516379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hamlet is also a story. Learn more about what happened recently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif70004.gif?t=1747516379\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3441200?t=1747516379","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747516379","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/7841fdd5887cb477b2774829edc6e4d43aea8974/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747516379","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/7841fdd5887cb477b2774829edc6e4d43aea8974/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747516379","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3499630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You arrive with just <strong>one\u00a0gold</strong>, and you want their <strong>ruby</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade, do quests, manage your resources wisely to get <strong>richer</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to locals and grow friendships, all while discovering their lore...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif27674.gif?t=1747516379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Befriend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You've officially come to help the village to recover from its recent hardships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(And officiously, to obtain their ruby.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accomplish the locals' quests to gain their trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3441200/extras/gif102017.gif?t=1747516379\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The m